        "original_id": "10c64ac9-c940-5f9d-b1e0-308f934a0407",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Al Hirt, Van Williams, Bruce Lee\n- Products: \"Java,\" Honey in the Horn, The Green Hornet theme song, The Green Hornet\n- Organizations: ABC\n- Roles: Green Hornet/Britt Reid, Kato\n- Topics: television, music recordings\n\nFacts:\n- In 1963, Al Hirt had million-selling recordings of \"Java\" and the accompanying album Honey in the Horn.\n- Al Hirt is also remembered for performing the theme song to The Green Hornet.\n- During the 1966–1967 television season, ABC aired The Green Hornet television series.\n- In the 1966–1967 television season, Van Williams starred in The Green Hornet as the Green Hornet/Britt Reid.\n- In the 1966–1967 television season, Bruce Lee starred in The Green Hornet as Kato.",
